--- !u!114 &1818432483
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1818432482}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: c64bcc9600fbd264194d7878f5f553fc, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  dialogue:
  - content: Ives?
    speaker: {fileID: 0}
    sfxName: 
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: "Headquarters placed your daughter under my watch. Odd way to say you
      need a babysitter, don\u2019t you think?"
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5e611c80cca3abf42b4a5c1a2294b953, type: 2}
    sfxName: 
    picture: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 1b3241f349d62e84682b58beac0b94cb, type: 3}
    events: []
  - content: "What? I don\u2019t know what you\u2019re\u2013"
    speaker: {fileID: 0}
    sfxName: 
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: <i>Deception.</i>
    speaker: {fileID: 0}
    sfxName: 
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: "Save it, Ailin. What\u2019s going on? First Jay goes missing, now you\u2019re
      flaking on me."
    speaker: {fileID: 0}
    sfxName: 
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: "<i>Ailin\u2019s gaze falters.</i>"
    speaker: {fileID: 0}
    sfxName: 
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: "The team\u2019s going out to find Jay, first thing tomorrow."
    speaker: {fileID: 0}
    sfxName: 
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: What? Without me?
    speaker: {fileID: 0}
    sfxName: 
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: I need you here for Jackie.
    speaker: {fileID: 0}
    sfxName: 
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: <i>Worthless.</i>
    speaker: {fileID: 0}
    sfxName: 
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: "Someone\u2013<i>anyone</i>\u2013else could do that! Let me come, Ailin!
      Jay is my comrade too."
    speaker: {fileID: 0}
    sfxName: 
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: "Do you not believe in me, after all we\u2019ve been through?"
    speaker: {fileID: 0}
    sfxName: 
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: "Of course I do... That\u2019s why I need you here!"
    speaker: {fileID: 0}
    sfxName: 
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: "If anything happens to us out there... If we don\u2019t make it back...
      Jackie will need you."
    speaker: {fileID: 0}
    sfxName: 
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: "You\u2019re the only one I trust with her, Ives."
    speaker: {fileID: 0}
    sfxName: 
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: "What about <i>you</i>? You\u2019re her mother."
    speaker: {fileID: 0}
    sfxName: 
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: "I know, but... I\u2019m the one who sent Jay out there. I have to find
      him. Please, Ives. Please just do this for me."
    speaker: {fileID: 0}
    sfxName: 
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: <i>Pathetic.</i>
    speaker: {fileID: 0}
    sfxName: 
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: "...You\u2019d better come back. I won\u2019t play babysitter forever."
    speaker: {fileID: 0}
    sfxName: 
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: "Sir, her heart rate is stabilizing. But her arm, it\u2019s still\u2026"
    speaker: {fileID: 0}
    sfxName: 
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: "I understand. But for now, there\u2019s not much else we can do."
    speaker: {fileID: 0}
    sfxName: 
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: "Her natural Amplitude levels are subsid\xADing, which should help curb
      the spread. As long as her \r\nvitals are stable, she should wake up soon.\r\n"
    speaker: {fileID: 0}
    sfxName: 
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: Cam...?
    speaker: {fileID: 0}
    sfxName: 
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: "Ah! Ives, thank goodness. You\u2019re awake. Your infection was...
      it got pretty bad."
    speaker: {fileID: 0}
    sfxName: 
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: "We\u2019re back at the base. This is Dr. Weise, he\u2019s been overseeing
      your recovery."
    speaker: {fileID: 0}
    sfxName: 
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: "Commander Ives. I\u2019m Dr. Aleksander Weise. A relief to see you
      conscious."
    speaker: {fileID: 0}
    sfxName: 
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: "...Where\u2019s Jackie?"
    speaker: {fileID: 0}
    sfxName: 
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: "She\u2019s safe. Still in the Tundra. She wouldn\u2019t leave your
      side until we had you on the WRV."
    speaker: {fileID: 0}
    sfxName: 
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: "She\u2019s... There was a look in her eyes, Ives. She\u2019s determined
      to stay."
    speaker: {fileID: 0}
    sfxName: 
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: "Good. ...How long until I\u2019m cleared? I need to get back out there."
    speaker: {fileID: 0}
    sfxName: 
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: Uh...
    speaker: {fileID: 0}
    sfxName: 
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: I'm afraid that won't be possible, Commander.
    speaker: {fileID: 0}
    sfxName: 
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: And why is that?
    speaker: {fileID: 0}
    sfxName: 
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: Although your condition has stabilized, the Waste vectors in your system
      exhibited... an unfortunate reaction.
    speaker: {fileID: 0}
    sfxName: 
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: To explain briefly, you must understand that all living beings transform
      energy to a specific unique <i>Frequency</i> signature before they are able
      to expend it for themselves.
    speaker: {fileID: 0}
    sfxName: 
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: When the waste binds to biology, it feeds on this transformed energy
      to replicate itself.
    speaker: {fileID: 0}
    sfxName: 
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: Thus it is imperative to neutralize it with the Anti-Waste serum before
      it becomes pervasive.
    speaker: {fileID: 0}
    sfxName: 
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: The way the Serum does this is by taking advantage of a major property
      of the Waste.
    speaker: {fileID: 0}
    sfxName: 
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: The Waste is naturally inclined to bind with objects of higher energy
      frequencies.
    speaker: {fileID: 0}
    sfxName: 
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: And so the Anti-Waste Serum is synthesized using special materials to
      have a very high frequency, higher than any natural biology found on earth.
    speaker: {fileID: 0}
    sfxName: 
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: As a result, when you receive the serum, the Waste binds to the serum
      instead of the body.
    speaker: {fileID: 0}
    sfxName: 
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: In addition, to ensure the Waste has insufficient energy to consume
      and replicate, we also ensure the energy signatures of the Serum have very
      low <i>Amplitude</i>.
    speaker: {fileID: 0}
    sfxName: 
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: However, something in the Tundra compromised the serum, causing its
      amplitude to spike.
    speaker: {fileID: 0}
    sfxName: 
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: Instead of neutralizing the Waste vectors, the injection acted as a
      catalyst for its spread instead.
    speaker: {fileID: 0}
    sfxName: 
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: The vector has spread through your entire system. To an extent where
      it is no longer feasible to purge.
    speaker: {fileID: 0}
    sfxName: 
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: "I\u2019m afraid the infection is permanent."
    speaker: {fileID: 0}
    sfxName: 
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: ...How bad is it?
    speaker: {fileID: 0}
    sfxName: 
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: It's not terminal.
    speaker: {fileID: 0}
    sfxName: 
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: But when the Waste consumes Amplitude, it increases the <i>Frequency</i>
      of the transformer energy as a byproduct.
    speaker: {fileID: 0}
    sfxName: 
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: "This will disrupt your body\u2019s natural ability to utilize energy,
      and cause major complications."
    speaker: {fileID: 0}
    sfxName: 
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: While we can manage the symptoms with suppressants and infusions, you
      will grow weaker.
    speaker: {fileID: 0}
    sfxName: 
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: Any significant physical exertion, especially in the field, will increase
      the amount of energy your body transforms.
    speaker: {fileID: 0}
    sfxName: 
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: And will drastically accelerate the Waste's spread.
    speaker: {fileID: 0}
    sfxName: 
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: ...
    speaker: {fileID: 0}
    sfxName: 
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: "I\u2019m gonna be out there as long as I can. I have to be there for
      Jackie."
    speaker: {fileID: 0}
    sfxName: 
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: ...
    speaker: {fileID: 0}
    sfxName: 
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: "Put me on the next re-supply transport. That\u2019s an order, Doctor."
    speaker: {fileID: 0}
    sfxName: 
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: ...
    speaker: {fileID: 0}
    sfxName: 
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: "Ives, you can\u2019t-"
    speaker: {fileID: 0}
    sfxName: 
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: As you wish, Commander. I will prepare a regimen of our strongest suppressants.
    speaker: {fileID: 0}
    sfxName: 
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: "Reichel? A word in my lab, when you\u2019re ready."
    speaker: {fileID: 0}
    sfxName: 
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: "Ives... I\u2019m so sorry..."
    speaker: {fileID: 0}
    sfxName: 
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: "Don\u2019t you start pitying me, kid. We both know this had nothing
      to do with you."
    speaker: {fileID: 0}
    sfxName: 
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: But it was my invention that failed to protect us... failed you.
    speaker: {fileID: 0}
    sfxName: 
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: Hey, I knew the risks. All of us did.
    speaker: {fileID: 0}
    sfxName: 
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: Far as I see it, your invention got the NITES further than anyone else
      ever has. One step closer to Ailin. One step closer to the truth.
    speaker: {fileID: 0}
    sfxName: 
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: "But I should\u2019ve known about the reaction, about the Frog. If only
      I knew more..."
    speaker: {fileID: 0}
    sfxName: 
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: "Hah, I\u2019m sure if you had known, we wouldn\u2019t have been able
      to step out that morning."
    speaker: {fileID: 0}
    sfxName: 
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: ...
    speaker: {fileID: 0}
    sfxName: 
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: Cam. I need you to understand something.
    speaker: {fileID: 0}
    sfxName: 
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: "I know you feel like shit right now. Like you\u2019re not enough."
    speaker: {fileID: 0}
    sfxName: 
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: "I\u2019ve been there, kid. Walked that line to the end and back."
    speaker: {fileID: 0}
    sfxName: 
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: But you know where that damn feeling of inadequacy comes from?
    speaker: {fileID: 0}
    sfxName: 
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: "From an expectation that you\u2019ve set for <i>yourself</i>."
    speaker: {fileID: 0}
    sfxName: 
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: Of what it looks like to be some ideal scientist or NITES or whatever.
    speaker: {fileID: 0}
    sfxName: 
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: "So when those expectations aren\u2019t met, that person you think you
      should be calls you worthless."
    speaker: {fileID: 0}
    sfxName: 
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: But the you that everyone else sees is not the same as that one in your
      head.
    speaker: {fileID: 0}
    sfxName: 
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: "No one\u2019s blaming you. I don\u2019t blame you. And I never will."
    speaker: {fileID: 0}
    sfxName: 
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: "The only person who\u2019s blaming you is yourself."
    speaker: {fileID: 0}
    sfxName: 
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: "So make peace with yourself. What\u2019s done is done."
    speaker: {fileID: 0}
    sfxName: 
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: "Accept that it\u2019s okay to not quite be where you want to be right
      now."
    speaker: {fileID: 0}
    sfxName: 
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: "Because if you keep focusing on where you\u2019ve tripped up, you\u2019ll
      never fully trust yourself to stand straight and walk forward again."
    speaker: {fileID: 0}
    sfxName: 
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: To become that person you truly want to be.
    speaker: {fileID: 0}
    sfxName: 
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: Got it?
    speaker: {fileID: 0}
    sfxName: 
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: Cam stays silent for a while, and eventually just nods.
    speaker: {fileID: 0}
    sfxName: 
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: So, what are you going to do now?
    speaker: {fileID: 0}
    sfxName: 
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: "I\u2019m going to get some answers. I promise."
    speaker: {fileID: 0}
    sfxName: 
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: Damn straight you are.
    speaker: {fileID: 0}
    sfxName: 
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: Thank you, Ives.
    speaker: {fileID: 0}
    sfxName: 
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  references:
    version: 2
